#chip mega328p, 16

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Wait 5 ms, arithmetic, an If with no Else and Wait 10 us together in one body
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 1,600,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Dim Xv As Byte
Dim Flag As Bit

Repeat for 100 ms
    Wait 5 ms
    Xv = Xv + 1
    If Flag = 1 Then
        Xv = 0
    End If
    Wait 10 us
End Repeat
Do
Loop
